        <p>Content on this site, including text and design elements, is owned by us or used with permission. You may not copy or reuse it for commercial purposes without written consent.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Maryland, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms may be directed through our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:underline">Contact page</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
